flowchart TD
  start([User logs in]) --> dash[View dashboard & fleet status]
  dash --> browse[Browse / filter robots]
  browse --> pick{Robot available?}
  pick -- No --> browse
  pick -- Yes --> detail[Open robot details]
  detail --> reserve[Reserve robot<br/>status → in_use]
  reserve --> use[Use robot for experiment]
  use --> release[Release robot<br/>log operating hours]
  release --> wear[System recomputes wear level]
  wear --> check{Wear ≥ threshold?}
  check -- No --> free[Status → free, available again]
  check -- Yes --> alert[Flagged on service-priority list]
  alert --> maint[Admin logs maintenance]
  maint --> reset[Wear clock reset<br/>status → free]
  free --> done([End])
  reset --> done
